      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prince_George%2C_Virginia"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Nestled along the James and Appomattox Rivers, Prince George County lies about 30 miles south of Richmond on I‑95.",
